@startuml ModeratedLMS CR1 Extension Workflow
title Moderated LMS - CR1 Extension Workflow

actor Lecturer
participant "Console (runLecturer)" as UI
participant Database
database "SQLite lms.db" as SQLite
actor Student

Lecturer -> UI : Select extension action
UI -> Lecturer : Choose whole class or individual
Lecturer -> UI : Enter assignment, deadline and reason
UI -> Database : grantClassExtension(...) / grantExtension(...)
Database -> SQLite : Check lecturer/course and assignment
Database -> SQLite : Validate deadline and marked-result rule
alt validation fails
  SQLite --> Database : Validation/query failure
  Database --> UI : Explicit error; transaction rolls back
  UI --> Lecturer : Show action failure
else valid class extension
  Database -> SQLite : Upsert class_extensions row
  Database -> SQLite : Refresh active SUBMITTED/LATE statuses
  Database --> UI : Commit
  UI --> Lecturer : Confirm class extension saved
else valid individual extension
  Database -> SQLite : Upsert extensions row for one student
  Database -> SQLite : Refresh that student's active status
  Database --> UI : Commit
  UI --> Lecturer : Confirm individual extension saved
end

Student -> UI : View enrolled courses and assignments
UI -> Database : assignmentsForStudent(student)
Database -> SQLite : Join enrolments, class and individual extensions
SQLite --> Database : Original and effective deadlines
Database --> UI : AssignmentRecord list
UI --> Student : Show original and effective deadline;\nlabel extension when effective differs

note over Database,SQLite
  Effective deadline is the later of the original,
  class-wide and individual deadlines. Submission
  acceptance and marking use the same value.
end note
@enduml
